version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-07-31'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/BackofenLab/vaRRI'
url: 'https://backofenlab.github.io/vaRRI/'
abstract: >-
  vaRRI is a browser-only JavaScript-based webservice for visualizing RNA-RNA
  interactions (RRIs) as 2D diagrams with annotations such as text, base-pair
  highlights, probability profiles, subsequence highlights, and point mutation
  annotations.
keywords:
  - RNA
  - RNA-RNA interaction
  - visualization
  - JavaScript
  - bioinformatics
